WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.469
- I SAW ON THE NEWS TODAY,

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:06.707
TALKING ABOUT THE VIOLENCE
IN FOREIGN COUNTRIES.

00:00:06.707 --> 00:00:09.676
TALKING ABOUT ALL THE SAVAGERY
UP IN THE WORLD,

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:14.848
BUT THEY AIN'T NEVER
TALK ABOUT SOUTH CENTRAL.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:19.152
AIN'T NEVER TALK ABOUT
WHAT HAPPENED TO MY BROTHER.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.421
NOW HE'S GONE.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:25.225
NOW I AIN'T GOT NO BROTHER.

00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:26.693
- YO, DOG.

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:33.166
I'LL BE YOUR BROTHER.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:34.601
- REALLY?

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.638
- ABSOLUTELY, DOG.

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:39.806
YOU'RE GONNA NEED SOMEBODY
TO LEAN ON.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.775
YOU CAN'T JUST BE
WALKING AROUND HERE

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.644
WITH THIS EMPTINESS
IN YOUR HEART, MAN.

00:00:43.644 --> 00:00:47.781
AN EMPTINESS THAT CAN ONLY
BE FILLED BY A BROTHER.

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.118
- OKAY.

00:00:51.118 --> 00:00:54.821
- BROTHERS, MAN?
- BROTHERS!

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.790
- GET IT IN HERE, DOG.
- COME OVER HERE.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.225
- YOU GOT TO GET IT IN THERE,
DOG.

00:00:58.225 --> 00:00:59.393
- I GOT TO TUCK IT, MAN.
[sighs]

00:00:59.393 --> 00:01:00.994
- TUCK IT, TUCK IT, TUCK IT.

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.229
BROTHERS, MAN.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:03.664
COME HERE, MAN.

00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:05.699
WHY THE [bleep] YOU KEEP
FOLLOWING ME AROUND, MAN?

00:01:05.699 --> 00:01:07.968
WHY DON'T YOU GO HOME
AND STAY OUT OF MY ROOM?

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:09.069
DON'T MESS WITH MY MODELS.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.337
I'M ABOUT TO GET A WEDGIE UP

00:01:10.337 --> 00:01:11.538
IN THIS MOTHER[bleep]
RIGHT HERE.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:12.673
- WHAT THE--HEY!

00:01:12.673 --> 00:01:13.974
HEY! GET THE [bleep]
OFF ME, MAN.

00:01:13.974 --> 00:01:15.609
- GIVE ME THE WEDGIE--HEY.

00:01:15.609 --> 00:01:17.544
- HEY.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:21.381
YOU DON'T GIVE A GROWN MAN
A WEDGIE.

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:24.217
MOTHER[bleep],
I'M 34 YEARS OLD.

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.688
I GOT GRANDCHILDREN.

